            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Ruth Jones"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have made these for three babyshowers co-ed, an engagement party, and a superbowl party. The guys love them! I make a seafood version that go well with these.",
            "datePublished": "2010-01-31T12:15:53.817Z"
